<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why SAP MM, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Everything a company buys, stores and consumes flows through SAP MM, which makes MM consultants essential to every S/4HANA migration now underway. With ECC support ending in 2027, procurement rollouts need MM talent exactly as you would enter the field.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>2027</b><span class="t">ECC mainstream ends</span><p>The global S/4HANA migration wave runs on MM consultants for every procurement scope.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>P2P</b><span class="t">The universal process</span><p>Every manufacturer, trader and retailer runs procure-to-pay; MM owns it.</p></div>
